# Zapret Turkey - Linux overlay (English)
# Loaded AFTER the shared ..\lang\en.lang: keys here override the shared
# ones (Windows wording) and add Linux-only keys (LNX_*).
# Format: KEY=Value. Save as UTF-8 without BOM.

# ---------- Generic ----------
LNX_NEED_ROOT=Root privileges are required. Restarting with sudo...
LNX_PRESS_ENTER=Press Enter to continue...
LNX_NOT_YET=This section is not ready in the Linux version yet - it will be added in a later step.
LNX_PROFILE_NONE=No profile files found in:
LNX_LANG_CHANGED=Language changed:
LNX_OPEN_FOLDER_FAIL=Could not open the file manager. Folder:
LNX_NO_SYSTEMD=systemd was not found on this system.

# ---------- Engine build (first run) ----------
LNX_BUILD_PROMPT=The nfqws engine is not built yet. Build it now? (needs internet, about a minute) [Y/N]:
LNX_BUILD_INSTALLING=Installing build packages...
LNX_BUILD_DOWNLOADING=Downloading the zapret source...
LNX_BUILD_COMPILING=Compiling nfqws...
LNX_BUILD_DONE=Engine ready:
LNX_BUILD_FAIL=Build failed. Read the error lines above.
LNX_BUILD_NO_PM=No supported package manager (apt, dnf, pacman) found. Install the build dependencies by hand and build nfqws.

# ---------- Wording that differs from Windows ----------
EXIT_WINWS_STILL_RUNNING=nfqws is still running. Stop it? [Y/N]:
STOP_OK=nfqws stopped.
STOP_ALREADY_STOPPED=nfqws was not running.
REASON_ENGINE_MISSING_HINT=nfqws is missing. Build it from the Start prompt or run the build command. Expected path:
REASON_NOT_ADMIN_HINT=The program must run as root (sudo).
REASON_NFT_MISSING_HINT=nft was not found. Install nftables first, for example: sudo apt install nftables
REASON_NFT_FAILED_HINT=The nftables rule could not be added, so nfqws was stopped again.

# ---------- Diagnostics wording ----------
DIAG_ADMIN_LABEL=Root privileges     :
DIAG_ENGINE_LABEL=nfqws               :
DIAG_WINWS_STATUS_LABEL=nfqws status         :
DIAG_CONFLICT_SECTION=--- Possible conflicting tools (official zapret) ---
DIAG_CONFLICT_HINT=(another zapret setup is active - do not run it at the same time as Zapret Turkey)
DIAG_CONFLICT_NONE=No known conflicting tool found.
LNX_DIAG_NFT_LABEL=nftables rule       :
LNX_DIAG_PRESENT=present
LNX_DIAG_ABSENT=absent
LNX_DIAG_HINT_CERT=certificate error - usually fake DNS answers from the modem
LNX_DIAG_HINT_RESET=connection reset - DPI block (is Zapret running? does the profile fit your ISP?)
