LNX_DNS_CONN_UNKNOWN=No connection with that name:
LNX_DNS_APPLY_FAILED=The DNS settings could not be applied.
LNX_DNS_UP_FAILED=The connection could not be restarted automatically. The settings are saved - reconnect to the network by hand.
LNX_DNS_RECONNECT_NOTE=The connection restarts for a moment, Wi-Fi may disconnect briefly.
